      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f5f8ea38a9be19b92c974d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊～？特雷森学园的大小姐找我们有什么事啊！\n我们这儿可没有什么修整得漂漂亮亮的跑道啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bcc47b7f77f9c56f6f280be1fb6c2c73c0032c1c1b7b14725ad19d59a0fffdf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34c3b63dc82a597bf445fdd2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊、嗯……你很努力嘛，练到这么晚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34f7f7f78adb928c4a5a7074775d8f72c465867193f64e8bfde0a71462285521",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
