      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我感觉到了呼唤……来到这里。\n这片我从未涉足过的土地，或许正是需要我跨越的考验！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc7273abada9fd0b9b78fe75301276c83f2497e0d431a3e04df1f91a222e2586",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
