      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽说统称为比赛，但赛马娘的身上蕴含着无限的可能。\n能获得光芒的舞台也因人而异……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38c0e07e03881c1f3bff2d9192f4b24610ca39784ba5195c2bfd79ad3b3f8ed4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7176a600acce442825ec2778",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以，你才在尝试各种不同的事情啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f74b1d814ee15be0fd7004843e736ecebc47ef121b490fb4e546d1e0b26b57b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
