    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3d6d6d072f340e87b0ad329",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以，必须要去寻找。自己命中注定该涉足的地方。\n然后，去跨越阻挡在眼前的那些考验……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a89fb7779a0c1d70c7ded4c97c0872a2677fe3212829026ee1a5ed4034fe5dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d0f591fee930a44d5fe3ab4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "<size=39>那个……如果不介意的话，我可以在旁边看看吗？</size>",
      "source_fingerprint": "696a1b4111440ddc922b4ffd821a06c6343d070cfcdc9447de735aa027c0748b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
