    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc614baa86178c26a1c9a0ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:555f2161998c047644fe92d9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵，非常感谢。\n为了迎战考验，仅仅靠白天的钻研可是远远不够的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38ef280f40056201854c915d17e6815fba5b2e64ada629a5f8074a9fbdb4b6ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20b229c568f4bbaa747dead3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b17d9573c79f5da0df8daa7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵……其实是圣女正在经受考验。\n不过，用这个世界的常识来解释，大概就是那么回事吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4471f011d893eb1fe821b039e641b3e21787c1706549154c0bbc2fd8c599adeb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1c1b8d3e9253b901573dda2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b161a718aeb967b2259664d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我深信不疑。等我跨越了考验、收集好所有的光芒后，\n我便会抵达那个属于我的地方……也就是『异世界』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8175b2542eb5dee7bcb63ed1f33dc3a8d06f7dfb5e8dc9d3d81e2da4fcd0553c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de237ca0c98c01a7df842e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a70ed01dfa143b426754e13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不仅仅是作为圣女的我。\n……大家其实都在像这样，探寻着属于自己的命运之路哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b31c930d2ed6ff541f2ac5320d14928543736e3229c43787e460886ec359ac2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ffff5f384df868680366055",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我差不多有些理解红色梦想的脑回路了。\n她似乎是在寻找一个最适合自己的舞台……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "591738d276f5598f4c05d4b0d17ef149da24c29411dedb3bea80675322276c5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f9bebb93cfe673efa9b4432",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这孩子是想要成为『特别』的存在吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "300b913283291e14a72dc181c368db71927ff4de545542611f3612170b4db3d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31cf55caeff5fe9890ac554a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以，她才会那般默默地拼命努力，去尝试各种各样的事情……\n虽然她嘴上说是在以异世界为目标……但说到底，其实就是……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "390d30f72a7c163cf74ab496d0985139d72c9b0447ef90e75d20eb76dd3ed01f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c9237cc1bf082e420b6eed0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我很理解这种心情。毕竟我自己上初中的时候，\n也曾幻想过有朝一日会成为『最强训练员』名扬天下——",
      "source_fingerprint": "279d5d4c81ad7d1424c5ee5fce5f2971b0d4609e6cf50b0575d5807cdb2c8e9b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7179f417170305a1ac300016",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "实况",
      "source_fingerprint": "50349a592c466fb97eeafeb81fd3fa65c8c3b2e779463937300c4c8f97230140",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d057046faa398bfc24543ad7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天才训练员·<username>！再次创下壮举！\n继达成三冠之后，终于成功制霸了『育马者杯』！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a048de522c707d308d473227003d9a6d865231f06563b967f13243e0f76626a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c11a7821621a95f28316be0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，随着年龄增长，那些妄想早已烟消云散。\n在认清了自己只是个『凡人』之后，便开始向现实妥协……",
      "source_fingerprint": "99234adc36276a3d804fa5f035d9607931987bd38f87cdb77ba739fb2f9e3229",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c819718cf5481b08d6511af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即便是才华横溢如她，也终有一天会从那不切实际的梦境中醒来。\n这是每个人都要经历的成长阵痛。只是，心中的执念越强，这股痛楚就越是剧烈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22252a02bb0d2f3ac9a79fa2cf351f5a0ee47bbc5ff4a86ad668ab5b2ba67609",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ab14186885659ea96bb3c7f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "万一，那一天真的来临，她会变得怎么样呢……。\n虽然有些多管闲事，但我还是忍不住替她感到担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "debf81bf05937e7a09bd9a802b4763f874d589c6d338af472a97b9d89f099848",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
